---
// OffMesh Delivery Status Demo - Honest Delivery Feedback Spec
---
<div class="delivery-demo">
  <div class="demo-intro">
    <span class="badge">UX Design Principle 2.2</span>
    <h3 class="demo-heading">Honest Delivery Feedback</h3>
    <p class="demo-sub">
      Unlike traditional apps that flash fake "Sent" ticks when you are offline, OffMesh provides cryptographically authenticated, transparent delivery states so you always know where your message is.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="stages-grid">
    <div class="stage-card">
      <div class="stage-header">
        <span class="stage-badge badge-queued">Stage 1</span>
        <div class="stage-icon icon-queued">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h4 class="stage-name">Queued Locally</h4>
      <p class="stage-desc">Stored in local encrypted database. Awaiting route or peer contact via BLE/Wi-Fi Direct.</p>
      <div class="stage-pill pill-queued">Pending Hop</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage-card">
      <div class="stage-header">
        <span class="stage-badge badge-forwarded">Stage 2</span>
        <div class="stage-icon icon-forwarded">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path d="M17 1l4 4-4 4"></path>
            <path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"></path>
            <path d="M7 23l-4-4 4-4"></path>
            <path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h4 class="stage-name">Relayed / Forwarding</h4>
      <p class="stage-desc">Encrypted blob accepted by intermediate peer. Peer cannot inspect plaintext payload.</p>
      <div class="stage-pill pill-forwarded">2 Relays Active</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage-card">
      <div class="stage-header">
        <span class="stage-badge badge-uploaded">Stage 3</span>
        <div class="stage-icon icon-uploaded">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <polyline points="16 16 12 12 8 16"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
            <path d="M20.39 18.39A5 5 0 0 0 18 9h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 3 16.3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h4 class="stage-name">Uploaded to Sync Gateway</h4>
      <p class="stage-desc">Encrypted blob stored on server cache for 7 days TTL. Transparently disclosed that recipient has not yet fetched it.</p>
      <div class="stage-pill pill-uploaded">Gateway Synced</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage-card">
      <div class="stage-header">
        <span class="stage-badge badge-delivered">Stage 4</span>
        <div class="stage-icon icon-delivered">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path d="M18 6L7 17l-5-5"></path>
            <path d="M22 10l-7.5 7.5L13 16"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h4 class="stage-name">Delivered & Verified</h4>
      <p class="stage-desc">Recipient's device decrypted packet and returned signed Ed25519 delivery receipt acknowledgment.</p>
      <div class="stage-pill pill-delivered">Cryptographically Confirmed</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .delivery-demo {
    margin: var(--space-12) 0;
  }

  .demo-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-10);
  }

  .demo-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  .demo-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .stages-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .stage-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .stage-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .stage-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .stage-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .badge-queued { background: #FEF3EB; color: var(--color-status-pending); border: 1px solid #FCD4BE; }
  .badge-forwarded { background: #EEF4FD; color: var(--color-status-info); border: 1px solid #D2E4FC; }
  .badge-uploaded { background: #F4F4F5; color: var(--color-text-primary); border: 1px solid #E4E4E7; }
  .badge-delivered { background: #EBF7EE; color: var(--color-status-success); border: 1px solid #C4E9CE; }

  .stage-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .icon-queued { color: var(--color-status-pending); background: #FEF3EB; }
  .icon-forwarded { color: var(--color-status-info); background: #EEF4FD; }
  .icon-uploaded { color: var(--color-text-primary); background: #F4F4F5; }
  .icon-delivered { color: var(--color-status-success); background: #EBF7EE; }

  .stage-name {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .stage-desc {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .stage-pill {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .pill-queued { background: #FFF8E6; color: #8A6500; }
  .pill-forwarded { background: #EEF4FD; color: #2457A7; }
  .pill-uploaded { background: #F4F4F5; color: #333333; }
  .pill-delivered { background: #EBF7EE; color: #167A45; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .stages-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 550px) {
    .stages-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
